WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.466
Hi, friends. This is My Brave Voice.

00:00:12.466 --> 00:00:16.932
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:16.932 --> 00:00:19.611
Hands flat on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.611 --> 00:00:22.291
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:22.291 --> 00:00:30.329
Your voice carries your ideas. An answer. A true thing. Something you love.

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:37.474
A brave voice says the thing out loud, even when the voice feels shaky.

00:00:37.474 --> 00:00:43.726
Nobody will be called on here. We practice on pretend moments, where it is safe.

00:00:43.726 --> 00:00:49.085
And your voice has steps: silent first, then a whisper, then out loud. Every step counts.

00:00:49.085 --> 00:00:57.124
Before the words come out, name the feeling in your mind: "I feel wobbly."

00:00:57.124 --> 00:01:02.483
A feeling with a name is easier to carry into words.

00:01:02.483 --> 00:01:08.735
Pretend moment one: it is sharing time. Say it silently, in your mind: "My favorite is drawing."

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:14.094
That was your brave voice, on its first step. The small light glows.

00:01:14.094 --> 00:01:22.132
Pretend moment two: the class is guessing what a plant needs. Whisper it: "I think it needs water."

00:01:22.132 --> 00:01:29.277
Now say it out loud, in your regular voice: "I think it needs water."

00:01:29.277 --> 00:01:35.529
Hear that? Your idea is in the room now. It started shaky, and it arrived.

00:01:35.529 --> 00:01:40.888
Name the feeling. Take the step. The light glows a little brighter.

00:01:40.888 --> 00:01:48.927
Pretend moment three: your group is building something together. Your idea: "I think we can build it taller."

00:01:48.927 --> 00:01:56.072
Say it on the step that fits today — silently, in a whisper, or out loud. All three are your brave voice.

00:01:56.072 --> 00:02:02.324
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:02.324 --> 00:02:05.897
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:05.897 --> 00:02:09.469
You're ready for what's next.
